 dh-dkms,
Standards-Version: 4.7.0

Package: hpuefi-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends:
 dkms,
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: HP UEFI kernel module source for DKMS
 The hpuefi kernel module gives userspace access to the HP
 BIOS through UEFI runtime services. The HP BIOS
 configuration and firmware update tools require it.
 .
 This package ships the module source for DKMS, which
 compiles the module for each installed kernel.
